Your stats may not be
high enough for that.

64
00:06:10,900 --> 00:06:15,900
Oh, well, I converted, so all my skills
have been transferred from another game.

65
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,420
If you say so.

66
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:22,245
So anyway, you picked a
heck of a game to play.

67
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,560
It's all grimy and stinks of oil.

68
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:28,680
Well, I've only played
fantasy games up to now.

69
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:32,560
They're fun, but I thought
I'd try a cyber game for once.

70
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:38,911
I was also interested in seeing
what gun battles were like.

71
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:40,730
Really?

72
00:06:40,813 --> 00:06:42,717
It takes guts to want
to start with B .O .B.

73
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,447
right off the bat like that.

74
00:06:45,780 --> 00:06:47,497
Let's hook you up with a gun, then.

75
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:49,051
I know this great market.

76
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:50,060
It's down here.

77
00:06:50,820 --> 00:06:51,650
Okay.

78
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:08,267
Wow, this place looks
like it has everything.

79
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:09,870
Yeah, well,

80
00:07:09,953 --> 00:07:11,517
the two types of weapons
that are mostly used

81
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:15,260
in GGO are optical guns
and live ammo guns. Huh.

82
00:07:16,060 --> 00:07:19,577
An optical gun's lighter and more
accurate, but it has its drawbacks.

83
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:23,657
If your opponent equips their defense
shield, it only does half the damage.

84
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:28,840
For a one-on-one tourney like B .O .B.,
a live ammo gun's the best bet. Oh, okay.

85
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,030
All right.

86
00:07:32,660 --> 00:07:34,037
Let's start with your stats.

87
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,179
Highest one first.

88
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:38,700
Um, I guess my strength is the highest.

89
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:40,400
And speed after that.

90
00:07:41,380 --> 00:07:43,760
You're an S-T-R-A-G-I type, huh?

91
00:07:45,060 --> 00:07:47,777
Okay, you've got two choices
for your main weapon.

92
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:51,500
Either a heavy assault rifle
or a large caliber machine gun.

93
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:56,904
Whichever one you choose, you're also going
to need a handgun for a backup weapon.

94
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,780
Oh, wait a sec.

95
00:07:58,980 --> 00:08:01,057
You said you just
converted over, didn't you?

96
00:08:01,140 --> 00:08:02,477
Do you have any credits?

97
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,060
Yeah, I should.

98
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:06,690
Let's see.

99
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:09,080
It says I have a thousand credits.

100
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,637
Everybody gets that when they start.

101
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,550
Oh.

102
00:08:13,980 --> 00:08:14,810
Hmm.

103
00:08:14,893 --> 00:08:18,597
If that's all you have, the most you can
afford's going to be a small ray gun.

104
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:22,856
And for a live ammo gun, a thousand
won't even get you a used revolver.

105
