Listen, if you want, I could
loan you the money to buy a gun.

106
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:32,477
That's really sweet of
you, but I couldn't.

107
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:33,580
Uh, I know.

108
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:35,637
Does this game have anything in it where a

109
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:38,117
new player like me could
go earn some money?

110
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:42,420
Well, I don't recommend them, but
there are casinos and gambling games.

111
00:08:42,860 --> 00:08:43,720
Like that one.

112
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:52,080
Hey, chicken! Come on!

113
00:08:52,980 --> 00:08:54,000
How do you play?

114
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:58,917
You enter through that gate and go down
the alley dodging the NPC's bullets.

115
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:02,677
The idea is to get as close as you
can to him without getting shot.

116
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:03,995
If you can touch him,

117
00:09:04,260 --> 00:09:08,557
you win all the cash everyone's sunk
into it since the last time it was beat.

118
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:09,470
All of it?

119
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,560
$300,000 change.

120
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:14,300
Now that is a heck of a lot of money.

121
00:09:14,540 --> 00:09:16,069
Well, no one's beating it.

122
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:19,437
Once you get eight meters
away from the gunslinger,

123
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:21,997
he switches to this wicked
fast quick-draw mode.

124
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:24,977
By the time you see the
bullet lines, it's too late.

125
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:26,140
The bullet lines?

126
00:09:26,940 --> 00:09:29,937
Look, another sucker's stepping
up to add to the jackpot.

127
00:09:30,020 --> 00:09:31,077
Today's the day, man.

128
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:32,500
Yeah, you got this.

129
00:09:32,660 --> 00:09:33,719
Here goes nothing.

130
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:42,540
I'm gonna blast you from here
to the moon, you varmint.

131
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:49,968
Watch me clear this
biatch and nothing flat.

132
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,017
Jackpot's yours.

133
00:09:51,100 --> 00:09:52,159
Yeah, you know it.

134
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:04,040
Why's he doing that?

135
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:12,400
Was that the bullet line? Yup.

136
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:14,577
It's a defensive system assist.

137
00:10:14,660 --> 00:10:15,600
We all have it.

138
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,940
Except for a sniper's first shot,

139
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:22,416
bullet prediction lines always show
up in the target's field of vision.

140
00:10:29,860 --> 00:10:32,380
I'll kill you, whatever!

141
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:34,350
Run, man!

142
00:10:34,433 --> 00:10:35,418
You still got this!

143
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:37,560
You loser!

144
00:10:47,780 --> 00:10:49,460
Game over, hoss!

145
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:53,740
Well, that sucked.

146
00:10:54,020 --> 00:10:55,785
That guy didn't have a chance.

147
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:57,130
See?

148
00:10:57,213 --> 00:11:00,297
The alley's so narrow, you can't
move too far to either side,

149
00:11:00,380 --> 00:11:03,297
and you're forced to charge
the gunslinger straight on.

150
00:11:03,380 --> 00:11:05,674
That's about as far as anyone's gotten.

151
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,620
Oh, I get it.

152
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:11,018
If I wait to see the bullet
lines, it'll be too late.

153
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,026
Uh, hey, where are you going?

154
00:11:20,420 --> 00:11:23,302
Ten Kirito says the newbie
gets it out of the gate.

155
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:25,697
Whoa, that's the cutest
target I ever seen.

156
00:11:25,780 --> 00:11:28,309
Let's stick around and
watch her get pwned.

157
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,260
I'll kill you!

158
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:50,240
You loser!

159
00:11:55,580 --> 00:11:56,640
You're kidding.

160
00:11:57,180 --> 00:11:58,945
She passed the ten meter mark.

161
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,860
That is one fast kid.

162
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,660
Die, you varmint.

163
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:08,160
I'll blast you to hell.

164
00:12:12,180 --> 00:12:14,298
Looks like someone's out of bullets!

165
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:35,106
Nooooooooooooooooooooooooooo!

166
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:54,500
Hey, Chicken, come on!

167
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:56,280
What the hell was that?

168
00:12:56,540 --> 00:12:57,780
Who is that kid?

169
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:02,600
Oh my god, I've never
seen reflexes like that.

170
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:08,200
I mean, at the end, you dodged his
lasers from about two meters away.

171
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:12,697
At that range, the time between you seeing
the bullet lines and the shots fired,

172
00:13:12,780 --> 00:13:13,610
well, that's it.

173
00:13:13,693 --> 00:13:16,444
There shouldn't have been
any time between them.

174
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:18,260
Oh, uh, really?

175
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:26,417
Well, since it's a game of dodging
bullets, I just predicted the bullet lines.

176
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:28,500
You know, predict the predictions.

177
00:13:30,140 --> 00:13:30,970
You...

178
00:13:31,053 --> 00:13:32,920
you predicted the predictions?!

179
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:35,110
Huh?!

180
00:13:37,340 --> 00:13:41,280
I'm confused about the specs
for this assault rifle. I mean,

181
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:42,517
this thing's ginormous,

182
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:46,617
so why is the caliber of the bullets it
fires smaller than a submachine gun's?

183
00:13:46,700 --> 00:13:49,177
I'm confused about how
someone like you can

184
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:51,907
dodge bullets like a
ghost and not know that.

185
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:54,180
You converted from another game.

186
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,937
What'd you play before this one?

187
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:57,300
Nothing special.

188
00:13:57,600 --> 00:14:00,365
Just one of those typical
fantasy games is all.

189
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:01,750
Hmm.

190
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:05,500
Yeah, so you said.

191
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,911
Well, during the B .O .B.

192
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:11,099
